---
layout: null
sitemap: false
---
{%- comment -%}
  QSD's Palette (_pages/palette.html, assets/js/colour/palette.js): every voyage's signature, colour
  line, colour order and frames' signatures (_data/photo_manifests/palettes.json, written by
  `npm run photos:fetch`, scripts/photos/lib/atlas.mjs palettesOf), with each gallery's page and
  title added here, and the name of each voyage told in parts (`prague` → "Prague"), for the page's
  list of voyages by place. With no palettes, an empty list: the page says the colours are still to come.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign palettes = site.data.photo_manifests["palettes"] -%}
{%- assign docs = site.voyage | concat: site.subvoyage | where_exp: "d", "d.gallery_name" -%}
{"pages":{ {%- for d in docs -%}{{ d.gallery_name | jsonify }}:{"url":{{ d.url | relative_url | jsonify }},"title":{{ d.title | strip_html | jsonify }}}{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}{%- endfor -%} },
"trips":{ {%- assign parents = site.voyage | where: "subgalleries", true -%}{%- for d in parents -%}{%- assign base = d.path | split: "/" | last | split: "." | first -%}{{ base | jsonify }}:{{ d.title | strip_html | jsonify }}{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}{%- endfor -%} },
"voyages":{% if palettes %}{{ palettes.voyages | jsonify }}{% else %}[]{% endif %}}
